# graphrag/app/common, graphrag/app/configs, ecc/app/common, ecc/app/configs
# are symlinks to the top-level common/ and configs/ dirs, materialized as
# plain files on checkouts with core.symlinks=false. Each Dockerfile already
# does its own COPY common /code/common, so keep these out of the build
# context or that COPY fails on "cannot copy to non-directory".
graphrag/app/common
graphrag/app/configs
ecc/app/common
ecc/app/configs
